[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さて……もうすぐ現場に着くけど、\r\n凛世、準備はできてるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00003",
    "bgm": "012"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010010,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……\r\n日本家屋での、撮影ですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030120020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、さすが凛世\r\n仕事の内容はバッチリ頭に入ってるな！",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "お役に立てるのでしたら、\r\n何よりでございます……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あまり肩に力を入れすぎないようにな……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "text": "っと、すまん電話だ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "se": "0103"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい、２８３プロ……お疲れ様です\r\nええ、ちょうどそちらに……はい、わかりました",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0106"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……何か、ございましたか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょうど先方からだった\r\n撮影前にちょっと打ち合わせが入ったから──",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "現場についたら、凛世は控え室で待機しててくれ\r\nひとりにさせてすまない",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\nよい物を、持参しておりますので",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世のことは、\r\nお気になさいませんよう……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか？\r\nわかった、終わったらすぐ呼びにいくからな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "bg": "00009"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black1",
