  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふぅ、どうにか無事に終わったな\r\nごめんな凛世、こんな時間になっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\n凛世は、幸せでございます……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "本日は……\r\nずっと、ご一緒できましたので……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あのな凛世、お昼もだけど、いくら漫画の台詞でも\r\nそういうことは不用意に言うもんじゃないぞ",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010260,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ご迷惑、でしょうか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、凛世はアイドルなんだし……\r\nそれに、そういうことは本当に大事な人にだな……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010270,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさまは、\r\n凛世の、大切なお人です……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？　ああ、だから、プロデューサーとしてだろ？\r\nそういう冗談は誤解を招くから、もうちょっと表現を、な",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010280,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、\r\n嘘や、冗談は……申しません",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010290,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……いえ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012003010300,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "プロデューサーさま\r\n凛世は、まだまだ……精進いたします……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200501/2012003010300"
